[{"id":"x:13136246779","platform":"x","post_id":"13136246779","published_at":"2010-04-30T15:53:32.000Z","text":"Be sure to look for my beautiful wife Melania Trump tonight on QVC at 9 pm ET where she will be debuting her fantastic jewelry collection.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13136246779","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:13074208628","platform":"x","post_id":"13074208628","published_at":"2010-04-29T15:22:03.000Z","text":"Melania will be on QVC tomorrow night at 9 p.m. ET to introduce her beautiful and inspiring Melania Timepieces & Fashion Jewelry collection.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13074208628","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:13008593779","platform":"x","post_id":"13008593779","published_at":"2010-04-28T14:13:32.000Z","text":"Melania and I will be appearing on Larry King Live tonight, 9 p.m. on CNN. Be sure to tune in for some great conversation!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/13008593779","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12884286007","platform":"x","post_id":"12884286007","published_at":"2010-04-26T13:58:13.000Z","text":"Our thoughts and prayers remain with Bret Michaels and his family and for his speedy recovery.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12884286007","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12707966134","platform":"x","post_id":"12707966134","published_at":"2010-04-23T15:22:08.000Z","text":"To put on your calendar for May: Miss USA 2010, live from Las Vegas on May 16th, 7 p.m. ET on NBC. I'll be there--tune in for a great show!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12707966134","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12642103351","platform":"x","post_id":"12642103351","published_at":"2010-04-22T14:31:53.000Z","text":"Melania and I will be appearing on The View tomorrow at 11 a.m. on CBS. Tune in for some great fun!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12642103351","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12580081834","platform":"x","post_id":"12580081834","published_at":"2010-04-21T14:43:32.000Z","text":"Melania and I saw American Idiot on Broadway last night and it was great. An amazing theatrical experience!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12580081834","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12535153342","platform":"x","post_id":"12535153342","published_at":"2010-04-20T20:12:33.000Z","text":"Tune in to The Marriage Ref onThursday night at 10 p.m. on NBC--I'm on the panel of experts along with Gloria Estefan & Adam Carolla.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12535153342","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12290268118","platform":"x","post_id":"12290268118","published_at":"2010-04-16T15:55:06.000Z","text":"On Sunday, Jerome Bettis 'the bus' from the Pittsburgh Steelers will play at Trump Int'l Golf Club/Palm Beach against Julius Erving 'Dr J'","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12290268118","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12183298109","platform":"x","post_id":"12183298109","published_at":"2010-04-14T20:49:24.000Z","text":"\"Before Kids Can Go Places, They Need a Place To Go\" -- the motto of The Police Athletic League, an organization I'm very proud to support","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12183298109","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12104502409","platform":"x","post_id":"12104502409","published_at":"2010-04-13T13:49:15.000Z","text":"Looking forward to seeing the World Champion Yankees today on opening day!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12104502409","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:12057473512","platform":"x","post_id":"12057473512","published_at":"2010-04-12T17:37:43.000Z","text":"The premiere of \"Donald J. Trump's Fabulous World of Golf\" is tomorrow night at 9 p.m. ET on Golf Channel. Tune in for a great adventure!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/12057473512","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:11889453121","platform":"x","post_id":"11889453121","published_at":"2010-04-09T16:36:36.000Z","text":"This is a terrific day for downtown New York. Trump SoHo is unlike anything else. Be sure to visit this fantastic hotel soon!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/11889453121","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:11782136751","platform":"x","post_id":"11782136751","published_at":"2010-04-07T19:23:18.000Z","text":"Trump SoHo opens this Friday and it is fantastic! Check out the Trump Hotel Collection...  http://www.trump.com/","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/11782136751","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:11710963303","platform":"x","post_id":"11710963303","published_at":"2010-04-06T18:08:19.000Z","text":"My bestselling book from last April, Think Like a Champion, is now available in paperback. It's inspiring, entertaining, and a great read.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/11710963303","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:11701179384","platform":"x","post_id":"11701179384","published_at":"2010-04-06T14:34:20.000Z","text":"Then we attended the Scottish fashion show that benefits veterans, Dressed to Kilt 2010, which I co-hosted with Sir Sean and Lady Connery.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/11701179384","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:11698350863","platform":"x","post_id":"11698350863","published_at":"2010-04-06T13:33:50.000Z","text":"Last night Melania and I attended the Skating with the Stars Gala at Wollman Rink in Central Park, it was fantastic. Stay tuned for Part 2..","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/11698350863","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:11439299597","platform":"x","post_id":"11439299597","published_at":"2010-04-01T18:51:10.000Z","text":"Today's open call drew thousands of eager applicants. It was an impressive group, I enjoyed meeting them. We've got some great candidates!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/11439299597","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"}]